@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - WebSocket Search Progress

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false

actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "WebSocketHandler" as WS
participant "SearchService" as Search
participant "OllamaClient" as Ollama
participant "InvertedIndex" as Index

User -> UI: Enter search query
UI -> WS: Connect /ws/search
activate WS

UI -> WS: Send {"query": "search text"}

WS -> Search: Start search(query)
activate Search

Search -> Ollama: expandQuery(query)
activate Ollama

Ollama --> Search: Expanded terms
deactivate Ollama

Search -> WS: Query expansion completed
WS --> UI: stage: query_expansion

loop For each expanded keyword
    Search -> Index: search(term)
    activate Index
    Index --> Search: Matching documents
    deactivate Index
end

Search -> Search: Merge and rank results

Search -> WS: Search results
WS --> UI: stage: keyword_search

Search --> WS: Search completed
deactivate Search

WS --> UI: stage: done
deactivate WS

UI --> User: Display results
@enduml